    "type": "service",
    "title": "ESA World Water Toolbox",
    "description": "Computes monthly water probabilities (water_probability), binary water masks (surface_water) and annual water indicators (Hydro-period Classification, Hydro-period Seasonality, Minimum Water Extent, Maximum Water Extent, Mean Surface Water Frequency) for a given period, from Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2, provided by DHI. `output` selects 'all', 'indicators' or 'monthly'; `output_format` selects GTiff or netCDF.",
